DESIGN_RULE_0=AI-DESIGN-TELLS AUDIT — Before delivering ANY UI/design work (TSX/JSX components, marketing pages, cover images, social graphics): score against the 26-point checklist in `~/.claude/skills/learned/ai-design-tells.md`. Canonical reference at `~/github/unstuckwithmolly/docs/ai-design-tells.md`. Report the score with deliverable. 6+ tells = iterate. 13+ = rebuild from brand-driven design.

DESIGN_RULE_1=NO GENERIC AI DEFAULTS — Avoid: gradient blob heroes (`absolute … blur-3xl` circles), symmetric N-col feature grids, `hover:-translate-y-1` on every card, centered-everything layouts, "Trusted by N companies" logo bars, glassmorphism (`bg-white/30 backdrop-blur-xl`), gradient pill CTAs with `→` in label, animated number counters, framer-motion fade-up on every section. These are the Lovable/v0 default aesthetic.

DESIGN_RULE_2=COLOR DISCIPLINE — Unstuck uses warm coral primary (`#d1726b`) + cream backgrounds (`#f9f7f6`). NEVER use indigo/purple/cool-blue primary (the shadcn default). Locked color semantics: Coral = Molly's voice / Gold = celebrations + page furniture / Sage = archive / Burgundy = canon (print only). Canonical: `~/github/unstuckwithmolly/public/brand-guide.md`.

DESIGN_RULE_3=TYPOGRAPHY DISCIPLINE — Body = Outfit Light (300). Headings = Cormorant Garamond Regular (400). Italic emphasis = `text-primary italic font-light` (NEVER italic + bold/semibold together). The headline pattern: main statement + `<span class="text-primary italic font-light">emotional hook</span>`. Bold should appear 1-2x per page max.

DESIGN_RULE_4=NO STOCK GEOMETRIC IMAGERY — Squiggly arrows, 3D blobs, gradient orbs, dotted-grid hero backgrounds, abstract neural-net diagrams = banned. Use the locked Soft Pink Sketch illustration style (`~/.claude/rules/brands/unstuck-image-style.md`) OR real photos OR real product screenshots OR confident negative space.

DESIGN_RULE_5=COMPONENT COURAGE — Don't wrap everything in shadcn `<Card>`. Build custom containers per context. Vary card radius by hierarchy (`rounded` badges, `rounded-2xl` cards, `rounded-3xl` hero containers). Vary shadow by elevation — most elements get NO shadow; reserve `shadow-luxury` (signature rose-tinted glow) for hover states + special moments.

DESIGN_RULE_6=COPY-IN-UI — Marketing/UI copy follows `learned/ai-tell-avoidance.md` AND the design-tells doc's Section 5: no banned words (unlock/transform/empower/level up/manifest), no vague benefit-stacking, no "Don't take our word for it" transitions, no "AI-powered" marketing when AI isn't the actual point, no single-word-sentence-as-style rhythm. Run drafts through `humanize-ai-writing` skill before merge.

DESIGN_RULE_7=THE 1-SENTENCE RULE — If you can't tell which company built this from the design alone, rebuild it until you can. The Unstuck brand only works if the visual identity is unmistakable.
